      "box_violation_frac": "fraction of the 4,131 reactions with v > ub + 1e-4 or v < lb - 1e-4, where (lb, ub) is FluxLayer.dynamic_box at this sample's availability and abundance. The box parameterization satisfies this by construction, so a nonzero value is a bug rather than an infeasibility.",
      "thermo_model_violation_frac": "fraction of active reactions (delta_r_g0_mask and not thermo_exempt) with v * delta_r_G > thermo_epsilon, using the layer's OWN delta_r_G from reaction_potential, which includes the learned concentration term. Available only when the arm's thermo_mode is not OFF.",
